      "Language": "eng",
      "Abstract": {"AbstractText": "This is a review of the symposium entitled Controversial Topics in Shoulder Arthroscopy 2001, presented at the Arthroscopy Association of North America 20th Annual Meeting in Seattle, Washington in April of 2001. The covered topics include micro-instability, partial thickness rotator cuff tears, pathology of the biceps tendon, and thermal capsulorrhaphy."},
